    "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:51:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-30T13:51:35Z",
    "body": "We're definitely fixing a bug here (one that we've needed to fix exactly this way in Gecko), since now with the `isSameDocument` check removed, it means that [#reload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reloading-and-traversing:fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event:~:text=reload%22%2C-,isSameDocument%20set%20to%20false) will also abort ongoing navigate events.",
